WEBVTT

00:01.094 --> 00:03.956
<i>[upbeat bluegrass music]</i>
<i>[欢快的蓝草音乐]</i>

00:04.025 --> 00:11.163
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:12.370 --> 00:15.301
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

00:15.370 --> 00:22.439
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:30.784 --> 00:31.922
Doy!
多伊！

00:31.991 --> 00:33.301
Bwah.
哇。

00:33.370 --> 00:35.404
I hereby franchise this planet
我特此特许经营这个星球

00:35.473 --> 00:38.197
in the name of the Krusty Krab.
以蟹堡王的名义。

00:38.266 --> 00:41.197
[laughs]
[loud rumbling]
[笑]
[巨响]

00:41.266 --> 00:43.646
Oh!
[whimpering]
哦！
[呜咽]

00:43.715 --> 00:45.370
Ah.
啊。

00:45.439 --> 00:46.784
Didn't you hear that?
你没听到吗？

00:46.853 --> 00:49.818
Wake up!
醒醒吧！

00:49.887 --> 00:52.818
[loud rumbling]
[巨响]

00:52.887 --> 00:54.301
[whimpers]
Gary,
[呜咽]
加里，

00:54.370 --> 00:56.473
I think there's
someone in the house.
我认为有
房子里有人。

00:56.542 --> 00:58.611
[yawns]
[哈欠]

00:58.680 --> 01:00.749
Aah!
啊啊！

01:02.232 --> 01:03.266
[loud crash]
[巨响]

01:03.335 --> 01:05.887
It's coming from downstairs.
是从楼下传来的。

01:05.956 --> 01:08.680
I'm scared,
but we got to go down there.
我很害怕，
但我们必须去那里。

01:08.749 --> 01:09.680
[meows]
[喵喵]

01:09.749 --> 01:10.853
Yes.
是的。

01:10.922 --> 01:12.715
- [meows]
- Yes.
- [喵]
- 是的。

01:12.784 --> 01:14.128
- [meows]
- Yes.
- [喵]
- 是的。

01:14.197 --> 01:15.508
- [meows]
- Yes.
- [喵]
- 是的。

01:15.577 --> 01:17.991
- [meows]
- Yes!
- [喵]
- 是的！

01:18.059 --> 01:20.818
[laughing evilly]
[邪恶地笑]

01:20.887 --> 01:22.956
[shuddering]
[颤抖]

01:23.025 --> 01:25.853
Okay, Gare Bear,
when I flip on the lights,
好吧，盖尔熊，
当我打开灯时

01:25.922 --> 01:27.577
you bark at the burglars.
你对着窃贼狂吠。

01:27.646 --> 01:29.128
[meows]
[喵喵]

01:29.197 --> 01:30.680
I mean roar,
roar at the burglars,
我的意思是咆哮，
对窃贼咆哮，

01:30.749 --> 01:33.094
like the fierce jungle
snail you are.
就像凶猛的丛林
你是蜗牛。

01:33.163 --> 01:34.887
[meows]
[喵喵]

01:34.956 --> 01:37.577
[growling]
[咆哮]

01:37.646 --> 01:38.922
[roaring]
[咆哮]

01:38.991 --> 01:40.646
[meows]
- Huh?
[喵喵]
- 啊？

01:40.715 --> 01:42.818
Narlene?
纳琳？

01:42.887 --> 01:46.818
Oh! Well, if it ain't
my old pal Gary.
哦！好吧，如果不是的话
我的老朋友加里。

01:46.887 --> 01:48.542
[meows]
[喵喵]

01:48.611 --> 01:49.991
Oh!
哦！

01:50.059 --> 01:51.680
Narlene Narwhal?
纳琳独角鲸？

01:51.749 --> 01:54.266
I haven't seen
you since we were kids.
我没见过
从我们小时候起就有你。

01:54.335 --> 01:56.611
both: Memory hug.
两者：记忆拥抱。

01:56.680 --> 01:59.646
[SpongeBob whimpering,
Narlene laughing]
[海绵宝宝呜咽，
纳琳笑了]

02:03.094 --> 02:05.266
Oh, look at you, SpongeBob.
哦，看看你，海绵宝宝。

02:05.335 --> 02:07.853
All grown-up-ified and proper.
一切都成熟了、得体了。

02:07.922 --> 02:10.094
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

02:10.163 --> 02:12.956
You came to visit <i>moi?</i>
你是来拜访<i>我的吗？</i>

02:13.025 --> 02:14.508
Well, you always said,
嗯，你总是说，

02:14.577 --> 02:17.404
"If you're ever
in Bikini Bottom, Narlene,
“如果你曾经
比基尼泳裤，Narlene，

02:17.473 --> 02:20.266
you can stay with me
as long as you like."
你可以留在我身边
只要你愿意。”

02:20.335 --> 02:21.922
[laughs]
[笑]

02:21.991 --> 02:23.922
Yeah, that sounds
like something I'd say.
是的，听起来
就像我想说的那样。

02:23.991 --> 02:26.197
Too bad your little brother
Nobby isn't here, too.
可惜了你的弟弟
诺比也不在这里。

02:26.266 --> 02:27.853
Oh, he's here. Hey, Nobby!
哦，他来了。嘿，诺比！

02:27.922 --> 02:29.301
Shake a horn and get on in here!
摇一摇喇叭，就到这里来吧！

02:29.370 --> 02:31.439
[speaking gibberish]
[胡言乱语]

02:31.508 --> 02:33.922
Howdy, SpongeBob.
你好，海绵宝宝。

02:33.991 --> 02:36.853
[speaking gibberish]
[胡言乱语]

02:36.922 --> 02:40.542
[coughs]
Wow, Nobby. You sure got big.
[咳嗽]
哇，诺比。你确实长大了。

02:40.611 --> 02:42.197
I need some vittles.
我需要一些食物。

02:42.266 --> 02:44.611
My fridge is
your fridge, Nobert.
我的冰箱是
你的冰箱，诺伯特。

02:44.680 --> 02:47.784
<i>[upbeat bluegrass music]</i>
<i>[欢快的蓝草音乐]</i>

02:47.853 --> 02:51.163
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:51.232 --> 02:52.784
Ah, we had a lot of good times
啊，我们度过了很多美好的时光

02:52.853 --> 02:54.922
riding through the woods
in your wagon.
骑马穿过树林
在你的马车里。

02:54.991 --> 02:56.508
[sniffs]
Ah, I can almost
[嗅嗅]
啊，我几乎可以

02:56.577 --> 02:59.473
smell the sea mule.
[sniffs]
闻海骡子的味道。
[嗅嗅]

02:59.542 --> 03:01.956
Huh?
- Hee-haw!
啊？
- 嘻哈！

03:02.025 --> 03:03.715
He remembers you, too.
他也记得你。

03:03.784 --> 03:06.646
[laughter]
[笑声]

03:09.784 --> 03:13.887
[braying]
[叫声]

03:13.956 --> 03:17.025
[both groaning]
[两人都呻吟]

03:24.404 --> 03:26.542
[yawns]
[哈欠]

03:30.646 --> 03:32.197
Oh! Aah!
哦！啊啊！

03:32.266 --> 03:34.106
Sorry, Narlene!
I didn't know you were in here!
对不起，纳琳！
我不知道你在这里！

03:34.163 --> 03:35.784
Morning, SpongeBob.
早上好，海绵宝宝。

03:35.853 --> 03:38.680
I just love your
fancy whirlpool bathtub.
我就是爱你
精美的漩涡浴缸。

03:38.749 --> 03:41.853
[toilet flushes]
Whoo!
[厕所冲水]
呼！

03:41.922 --> 03:43.577
[laughing]
[笑]

03:43.646 --> 03:46.749
Would you be a darling
and hand me a scrub brush?
你会是一个亲爱的吗
递给我一把刷子？

03:52.473 --> 03:53.818
- Oh!
- Thank you.
- 哦！
- 谢谢。

03:53.887 --> 03:56.232
[laughs]
[笑]

03:56.301 --> 03:57.922
Hurry it up.
快点吧。

03:57.991 --> 04:01.025
Other people need
to use the whirlpool bathtub.
其他人需要
使用漩涡浴缸。

04:02.508 --> 04:05.646
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:09.232 --> 04:11.370
Ahhh...
啊啊...

04:19.094 --> 04:20.991
[meows]
[喵喵]

04:25.680 --> 04:28.128
<i>[upbeat bluegrass music]</i>
<i>[欢快的蓝草音乐]</i>

04:28.197 --> 04:30.025
Yeah.
是的。

04:30.094 --> 04:35.577
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:35.646 --> 04:37.335
<i>[turkey gobbling]</i>
<i>[火鸡狼吞虎咽]</i>

04:37.404 --> 04:39.680
Ah, Thanksgiving.
啊，感恩节。

04:43.025 --> 04:45.749
[grunting goofily]
[愚蠢地咕哝]

04:47.059 --> 04:48.163
Huh?
啊？

04:48.232 --> 04:49.370
[grunting goofily]
[愚蠢地咕哝]

04:49.439 --> 04:52.577
Aah!
啊啊！

04:54.335 --> 04:57.301
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:57.370 --> 04:59.542
Ta-da!
- Oh.
哒哒！
- 哦。

04:59.611 --> 05:01.577
Hoo-hoo! Let's go.
呼呼！我们走吧。

05:01.646 --> 05:03.094
I hope you don't mind
that we made
我希望你不介意
我们做的

05:03.163 --> 05:04.473
your house all hill-ified.
你的房子全是山地化的。

05:04.542 --> 05:06.232
Hill-ified?
希尔化？

05:06.301 --> 05:07.887
Why, I'm...
为什么，我...

05:07.956 --> 05:09.301
thrill-ified.
兴奋化。

05:09.370 --> 05:10.991
Yee-hoo!
呀呼！

05:11.059 --> 05:13.301
[knock on door]
[敲门]

05:13.370 --> 05:15.266
Howdy. Is Narlene here?
你好。纳琳在吗？

05:15.335 --> 05:18.128
It's Cousin WillyBob!
这是威利鲍勃表弟！

05:18.197 --> 05:20.197
Ha ha!
哈哈！

05:20.266 --> 05:22.232
WillyBob, meet SpongeBob.
威利鲍勃，遇见海绵宝宝。

05:22.301 --> 05:24.059
Hey, SpongeBob, meet WillyBob.
嘿，海绵宝宝，来认识一下威利鲍勃吧。

05:24.128 --> 05:25.301
Hoo-hoo-hoo!
呼呼呼！

05:25.370 --> 05:26.887
Well, any cousin of Narlene's
好吧，纳琳的任何表弟

05:26.956 --> 05:29.749
is a cousin of mine, WillyBob.
是我的表弟，威利鲍勃。

05:31.577 --> 05:34.266
Well, much obliged, CousinBob.
嗯，非常感谢，鲍勃表弟。

05:34.335 --> 05:37.715
Come on, Nobby, let's wrassle!
来吧，诺比，我们来打一架吧！

05:42.577 --> 05:43.956
Yeah!
是的！

05:44.025 --> 05:47.059
Hey, cousins, save some for me.
嘿，表弟们，给我留点吧。

05:47.128 --> 05:48.508
[growls]
[咆哮]

05:48.577 --> 05:51.128
[knocking on door]
Huh?
[敲门]
啊？

05:51.197 --> 05:52.473
Is Narlene here?
纳琳在吗？

05:52.542 --> 05:54.335
Welcome, welcome.
欢迎，欢迎。

05:54.404 --> 05:55.853
Any cousin of Narlene's is a...
纳琳的任何表弟都是……

05:55.922 --> 05:58.128
[knocking on door]
Huh.
[敲门]
呵呵。

05:58.197 --> 06:01.094
[all shouting]
[大家大喊]

06:03.163 --> 06:04.542
[meows]
[喵喵]

06:04.611 --> 06:07.473
[bluegrass music playing]
[蓝草音乐演奏]

06:07.542 --> 06:14.749
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:16.163 --> 06:19.163
[growls angrily]
[愤怒地咆哮]

06:19.232 --> 06:24.853
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:24.922 --> 06:27.163
Hey, Cousin SquidBob,
嘿，鱿鱼鲍勃表弟，

06:27.232 --> 06:29.232
let's square-dance.
我们来跳广场舞吧。

06:29.301 --> 06:32.163
[Squidward yelling]
[章鱼哥大喊]

06:33.646 --> 06:36.473
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

06:36.542 --> 06:38.266
Breaking news!
突发新闻！

06:38.335 --> 06:41.232
Bikini Bottom
is under siege from narwhals.
比基尼泳裤
受到独角鲸的围攻。

06:41.301 --> 06:43.404
<i>Toothless hoards
of backwoods hill folk</i>
<i>无牙囤积者
边远山区的民俗</i>

06:43.473 --> 06:45.784
<i>are plaguing citizens
with jug-band music,</i>
<i>正在困扰公民
伴随着壶乐队音乐，</i>

06:45.853 --> 06:48.680
<i>hog calling, and bad grammar.</i>
<i>胡言乱语，语法错误。</i>

06:51.680 --> 06:54.266
Citizens are advised
to stay indoors
建议市民
待在室内

06:54.335 --> 06:58.370
and to avoid stomping your feet
to the country-fied beat.
并避免跺脚
配合乡村节奏。

06:58.439 --> 06:59.887
Aah!
啊啊！

06:59.956 --> 07:02.887
They's here! Save yourselves!
他们来了！救救你们自己吧！

07:02.956 --> 07:05.853
Aah!
[static whirs]
啊啊！
[静电呼呼声]

07:08.059 --> 07:10.473
Yikes.
哎呀。

07:10.542 --> 07:12.025
I think maybe it's time
我想也许是时候了

07:12.094 --> 07:13.887
to ask your kin
to leave, Narlene.
去问你的亲戚
离开吧，纳琳。

07:13.956 --> 07:15.784
They're not my kin.
他们不是我的亲戚。

07:15.853 --> 07:17.749
I thought they was your kin.
我以为他们是你的亲戚。

07:17.818 --> 07:19.922
WillyBob is our only relation.
威利鲍勃是我们唯一的亲戚。

07:19.991 --> 07:22.335
[speaking gibberish]
[胡言乱语]

07:22.404 --> 07:24.025
Nobby's right.
诺比是对的。

07:24.094 --> 07:26.197
The rest of them
ain't even narwhals.
其余的人
连独角鲸都不是。

07:26.266 --> 07:28.508
[speaking gibberish]
[胡言乱语]

07:28.577 --> 07:30.266
They're Nearwhals.
他们是近鲸。

07:30.335 --> 07:33.094
Phony little varmint.
虚伪的小害虫。

07:33.163 --> 07:34.680
Kin or no kin,
有亲属或无亲属，

07:34.749 --> 07:37.404
we got to hog-tie this hoedown.
我们必须把这个锄头绑起来。

07:37.473 --> 07:39.784
Well, the good news is...
嗯，好消息是...

07:39.853 --> 07:41.991
I think I know someone
who can help us.
我想我认识一个人
谁可以帮助我们。

07:42.059 --> 07:43.301
[cheers]
[干杯]

07:43.370 --> 07:45.646
[speaking gibberish]
[胡言乱语]

07:45.715 --> 07:48.370
What's the bad news?
坏消息是什么？

07:48.439 --> 07:49.991
<i>Sure.</i>
<i>当然。</i>

07:50.059 --> 07:52.646
<i>I can get rid of those
Nearwhal nimrods for you.</i>
<i>我可以摆脱那些
近鲸尼姆罗德给你。</i>

07:52.715 --> 07:54.163
<i>[laughs evilly]</i>
<i>[邪恶地笑]</i>

07:54.232 --> 07:56.749
Their stupid family
has been feuding
他们愚蠢的一家人
一直在争吵

07:56.818 --> 07:59.611
with my stupid family for years.
和我愚蠢的家人在一起很多年了。

07:59.680 --> 08:01.439
Oh, I seen it.
哦，我看到了。

08:01.508 --> 08:04.163
Them Planktons sure
know how to hold a grudge.
他们肯定是浮游生物
懂得记仇。

08:04.232 --> 08:05.680
Mm-mm-mm-mm-mm.
毫米-毫米-毫米-毫米-毫米。

08:05.749 --> 08:08.922
Ah.
[grunts]
啊。
[咕哝]

08:08.991 --> 08:11.887
<i>[light banjo music]</i>
<i>[轻班卓琴音乐]</i>

08:11.956 --> 08:13.577
[phone ringing]
[电话铃声]

08:13.646 --> 08:15.508
Aah!
啊啊！

08:15.577 --> 08:18.335
How do?
怎么办？

08:18.404 --> 08:21.232
Nearwhals!
近鲸！

08:21.301 --> 08:22.853
all: Nearwhals?
所有人：近鲸？

08:22.922 --> 08:25.991
Nearwhals?
Nearwhals?
近鲸？
近鲸？

08:26.059 --> 08:28.473
Feud!
世仇！

08:28.542 --> 08:30.749
Voilà! Huh?
瞧！啊？

08:30.818 --> 08:31.991
[all shouting]
[大家大喊]

08:32.059 --> 08:34.956
<i>[upbeat bluegrass music]</i>
<i>[欢快的蓝草音乐]</i>

08:35.025 --> 08:37.473
Get them Nearwhals!
抓住他们近鲸！

08:37.542 --> 08:44.508
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

08:44.577 --> 08:46.922
[speaking gibberish]
[胡言乱语]

08:46.991 --> 08:48.542
Huh?
啊？

08:48.611 --> 08:50.715
Consarn Nearwhals!
康萨恩近鲸！

08:50.784 --> 08:54.749
[rapid chomping]
[快速咀嚼]

08:54.818 --> 08:57.749
Give 'em the itch, Planktons.
让他们感到痒痒吧，浮游生物。

09:03.197 --> 09:05.646
It's a plankton sneak attack.
这是浮游生物的偷袭。

09:05.715 --> 09:09.301
Nearwhals, retreat!
近鲸们，撤退！

09:09.370 --> 09:11.680
[horn blaring]
[喇叭声]

09:11.749 --> 09:13.439
What's that, now?
那是什么，现在？

09:13.508 --> 09:17.680
[horns blaring]
[喇叭声]

09:17.749 --> 09:24.853
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

09:37.094 --> 09:40.266
Yeah!
[laughter]
是的！
[笑声]

09:40.335 --> 09:42.404
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

09:42.473 --> 09:43.577
Thank you.
谢谢。

09:43.646 --> 09:44.991
Yeah!
是的！

09:45.059 --> 09:47.749
I think someone deserves
a little kiss.
我认为有人值得
一个小小的吻。

09:47.818 --> 09:50.370
Ooh!
[smooching]
哦！
[接吻]

09:52.577 --> 09:54.542
Ew.
呃。

09:54.611 --> 09:56.853
Thankee, Cousin Plankee.
谢谢，普兰基表弟。

09:56.922 --> 10:00.128
[giggles]
- [grunting]
[咯咯笑]
- [咕哝]

10:00.197 --> 10:01.439
Yuck.
恶心。

10:01.508 --> 10:06.301
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

10:06.370 --> 10:08.232
[speaking gibberish]
[胡言乱语]

10:08.301 --> 10:11.025
Y'all take care now.
[speaking gibberish]
你们现在要保重。
[胡言乱语]

10:11.094 --> 10:14.956
[laughs]
I already miss you guys.
[笑]
我已经想念你们了。

10:15.025 --> 10:17.818
Will you come back
and visit us real soon?
你会回来吗
很快就会来拜访我们吗？

10:17.887 --> 10:19.611
Sooner than you think.
比你想象的要早。

10:19.680 --> 10:21.749
